{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31550","headline":"长沙开元寺昔与故长林许侍御题松竹联句 · 李羣玉","name":"长沙开元寺昔与故长林许侍御题松竹联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"墙阴数行字，怀旧惨伤情。\n薜荔侵年月，莓苔压姓名。\n逝川前後水，浮世短长生。\n独立秋风暮，凝颦隔郢城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}